  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given chemical reaction is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>Br</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>BrO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>&#10230;</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>Br</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced><mi>l</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Rate law expression for the given reaction can be written as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>Br</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced></mrow><mi>&#916;t</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msubsup><mi>BrO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></mfenced></mrow><mi>&#916;t</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced></mrow><mi>&#916;t</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msub><mi>Br</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow><mi>&#916;t</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>Br</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced></mrow><mi>&#916;t</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msubsup><mi>BrO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></mfenced></mrow><mi>&#916;t</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced></mrow><mi>&#916;t</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>Br</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced></mrow><mi>&#916;t</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced></mrow><mi>&#916;t</mi></mfrac></math></p>"
